    "axis": "clarity",
    "evidence": "The headline, side-by-side 100% recalls, visible 0% regression gap, and deployment decision consistently communicate that this is stability evidence—not production readiness—and that an independent holdout is still required. However, “independent_holdout=false,” “fresh-row D,” and provenance details depend on specialist jargon; supporting text is very small, especially on mobile; and the screen states the required next step without offering a clear action to initiate or inspect that independent holdout. The mobile/tablet header also hides Vault offscreen, weakening location awareness.",
    "fix": "Add a prominent next-action control such as “Run independent holdout” or “View holdout requirements,” explain the key jargon in plain language beside the metrics, increase supporting-text size/contrast, and keep the current Vault location visible in the horizontally scrolling header.",
